; The zone hub's spinning orb, rebuilt from DefineSprite 3196 (see
; dev/urchin_dev/swf/extract/zone_hub.py, which prints these numbers). 3196
; stacks two shapes, not three: the outer arc pair twice - once turned a
; quarter turn, once upright and smaller - with the inner arc pair on top.
; Each Sprite2D's scale is the SWF's own scale over 5, because the textures
; are exported at 5x. The result is the orb's real ~48px size, so the zone
; scenes place it at scale 1 rather than compensating.
